{"seq":2,"slug":"dockerfile-best-practices","title":"Dockerfile 最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/dockerfile-best-practices","wordCount":1030,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"dockerfile-最佳实践\">Dockerfile 最佳实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Dockerfile 是构建容器镜像的<strong>声明式脚本</strong>，每条 <code>RUN</code>、<code>COPY</code>、<code>ADD</code> 指令生成一个只读镜像层。围绕它有三个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>层缓存（Layer Cache）</strong>：某一层的输入未变化时，Docker 直接复用缓存而不重新执行，指令顺序因此直接影响构建速度。</li>\n<li><strong>多阶段构建（Multi-stage Build）</strong>：在一个 Dockerfile 中用多个 <code>FROM</code> 阶段分离构建环境与运行环境，只把产物复制进最终镜像。</li>\n<li><strong>构建上下文（Build Context）</strong>：发送给 Docker Daemon 的文件集合，由 <code>.dockerignore</code> 裁剪，决定构建传输量与泄漏面。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这三点是写出体积小、构建快、运行安全镜像的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dockerfile-基础结构\">Dockerfile 基础结构</h2><p>Dockerfile 是构建容器镜像的声明式脚本，每条指令创建镜像的一个新层。编写高质量的 Dockerfile 直接影响镜像大小、构建速度和运行时安全性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"FROM node:20-alpine AS base&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./&#10;RUN corepack enable &amp;&amp; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;COPY . .&#10;RUN pnpm build&#10;FROM node:20-alpine AS runtime&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY --from=base /app/dist ./dist&#10;COPY --from=base /app/node_modules ./node_modules&#10;USER 1000:1000&#10;EXPOSE 3000&#10;CMD [&quot;node&quot;, &quot;dist/index.js&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN corepack enable &#x26;&#x26; pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pnpm build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS runtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=base /app/dist ./dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=base /app/node_modules ./node_modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>USER 1000:1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EXPOSE 3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"node\", \"dist/index.js\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>是否创建新层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FROM</td>\n<td>指定基础镜像</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WORKDIR</td>\n<td>设置工作目录</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COPY</td>\n<td>复制文件到镜像</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RUN</td>\n<td>执行命令</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CMD</td>\n<td>容器启动命令</td>\n<td>否（元数据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXPOSE</td>\n<td>声明端口</td>\n<td>否（元数据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ENV</td>\n<td>设置环境变量</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARG</td>\n<td>构建时变量</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>USER</td>\n<td>指定运行用户</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ENTRYPOINT</td>\n<td>入口点命令</td>\n<td>否（元数据）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多阶段构建\">多阶段构建</h2><p>多阶段构建（Multi-stage Build）是优化镜像大小的核心技术。通过在一个 Dockerfile 中定义多个 <code>FROM</code> 阶段，将构建依赖与运行时依赖分离。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 构建阶段&#10;        S1[Stage 1: build&lt;br/&gt;安装编译工具&lt;br/&gt;编译源码]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 运行阶段&#10;        S2[Stage 2: runtime&lt;br/&gt;仅复制产物&lt;br/&gt;最小化依赖]&#10;    end&#10;    S1 --&gt;|COPY --from=build| S2\">graph LR\n    subgraph 构建阶段\n        S1[Stage 1: build&lt;br/&gt;安装编译工具&lt;br/&gt;编译源码]\n    end\n    subgraph 运行阶段\n        S2[Stage 2: runtime&lt;br/&gt;仅复制产物&lt;br/&gt;最小化依赖]\n    end\n    S1 --&gt;|COPY --from=build| S2</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"FROM golang:1.22-alpine AS build&#10;WORKDIR /src&#10;COPY go.mod go.sum ./&#10;RUN go mod download&#10;COPY . .&#10;RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -ldflags=&quot;-s -w&quot; -o /app/server ./cmd/server&#10;&#10;FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12 AS runtime&#10;COPY --from=build /app/server /server&#10;ENTRYPOINT [&quot;/server&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM golang:1.22-alpine AS build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /src</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY go.mod go.sum ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN go mod download</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -ldflags=\"-s -w\" -o /app/server ./cmd/server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12 AS runtime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=build /app/server /server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ENTRYPOINT [\"/server\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不同基础镜像对最终镜像大小的影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基础镜像</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>包管理器</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ubuntu:24.04</td>\n<td>~78 MB</td>\n<td>apt</td>\n<td>开发调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>alpine:3.19</td>\n<td>~7 MB</td>\n<td>apk</td>\n<td>通用轻量生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gcr.io/distroless/static</td>\n<td>~2 MB</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Go 静态二进制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>scratch</td>\n<td>0 MB</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>极致最小化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>debian:bookworm-slim</td>\n<td>~75 MB</td>\n<td>apt</td>\n<td>需要 glibc</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>scratch</code> 作为基础镜像可以构建出最小的镜像，但容器内没有 shell 和任何工具，调试困难。建议生产环境使用 distroless 镜像，它提供了最小的运行时环境，同时包含 CA 证书和时区数据。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"层缓存优化\">层缓存优化</h2><p>Docker 使用层缓存加速构建。当某一层的输入没有变化时，Docker 直接复用缓存而不重新执行。理解缓存失效规则是优化构建速度的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[FROM node:20-alpine] --&gt;|缓存命中| B[WORKDIR /app]&#10;    B --&gt;|缓存命中| C[COPY package.json ./]&#10;    C --&gt;|文件变化?| D{缓存失效}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[使用缓存 RUN npm install]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[重新执行 RUN npm install]&#10;    F --&gt; G[COPY . .]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[RUN npm build]\">graph TD\n    A[FROM node:20-alpine] --&gt;|缓存命中| B[WORKDIR /app]\n    B --&gt;|缓存命中| C[COPY package.json ./]\n    C --&gt;|文件变化?| D{缓存失效}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[使用缓存 RUN npm install]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[重新执行 RUN npm install]\n    F --&gt; G[COPY . .]\n    E --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[RUN npm build]</pre><p>关键优化策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./&#10;RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;COPY tsconfig.json ./&#10;COPY src/ ./src/&#10;RUN pnpm build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY tsconfig.json ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY src/ ./src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pnpm build</span></span></code></pre></div><p>错误示范与正确做法对比：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"RUN apt-get update&#10;RUN apt-get install -y curl&#10;RUN apt-get install -y git&#10;&#10;RUN apt-get update &amp;&amp; \\&#10;    apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \\&#10;      curl \\&#10;      git &amp;&amp; \\&#10;    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>RUN apt-get update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN apt-get install -y curl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN apt-get install -y git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN apt-get update &#x26;&#x26; \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      curl \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      git &#x26;&#x26; \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖文件先复制</td>\n<td>代码变更不触发重装依赖</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并 RUN 指令</td>\n<td>减少镜像层数</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理缓存文件</td>\n<td>减小镜像体积</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 .dockerignore</td>\n<td>减少构建上下文</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定依赖版本</td>\n<td>构建可重复</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"安全加固\">安全加固</h2><p>安全是 Dockerfile 编写中不可忽视的维度。遵循最小权限原则，减少攻击面。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"FROM node:20-alpine&#10;&#10;RUN addgroup -g 1001 appgroup &amp;&amp; \\&#10;    adduser -u 1001 -G appgroup -D appuser&#10;&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY --chown=appuser:appgroup . .&#10;&#10;RUN npm ci --omit=dev&#10;&#10;USER appuser&#10;&#10;HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=3s --retries=3 \\&#10;  CMD wget --no-verbose --tries=1 --spider http://localhost:3000/health || exit 1&#10;&#10;CMD [&quot;node&quot;, &quot;src/index.js&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN addgroup -g 1001 appgroup &#x26;&#x26; \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    adduser -u 1001 -G appgroup -D appuser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --chown=appuser:appgroup . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN npm ci --omit=dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>USER appuser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=3s --retries=3 \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  CMD wget --no-verbose --tries=1 --spider http://localhost:3000/health || exit 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"node\", \"src/index.js\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker scout cves nginx:alpine&#10;&#10;docker run --rm -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \\&#10;  aquasec/trivy image nginx:alpine\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> scout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cves</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  aquasec/trivy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nginx:alpine</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远不要在 Dockerfile 中硬编码密钥、令牌或密码。使用 Docker BuildKit 的 <code>--secret</code> 挂载或运行时的环境变量注入来管理敏感信息。<code>docker history</code> 命令可以查看镜像的所有层，任何通过 <code>ENV</code> 或 <code>COPY</code> 写入的数据都会被永久记录。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dockerignore-与构建上下文\">.dockerignore 与构建上下文</h2><p><code>.dockerignore</code> 文件控制哪些文件被发送到构建上下文，直接影响构建速度和镜像安全性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"node_modules&#10;.git&#10;.env&#10;.env.*&#10;dist&#10;*.log&#10;.DS_Store&#10;coverage&#10;.nyc_output&#10;Dockerfile*&#10;docker-compose*&#10;README.md\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">node_modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.env.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.DS_Store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.nyc_output</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Dockerfile*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker-compose*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">README.md</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应忽略的文件</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>node_modules</td>\n<td>应在容器内重新安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.git</td>\n<td>避免泄露版本历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.env</td>\n<td>包含敏感环境变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dist/build</td>\n<td>应在容器内重新构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>*.log</td>\n<td>无用的运行时日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dockerfile</td>\n<td>避免递归包含</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 构建流程&#10;        CTX[构建上下文] --&gt;|过滤| IGN[.dockerignore]&#10;        IGN --&gt;|发送| DAEMON[Docker Daemon]&#10;        DAEMON --&gt;|执行| DF[Dockerfile]&#10;        DF --&gt;|产出| IMG[镜像]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 构建流程\n        CTX[构建上下文] --&gt;|过滤| IGN[.dockerignore]\n        IGN --&gt;|发送| DAEMON[Docker Daemon]\n        DAEMON --&gt;|执行| DF[Dockerfile]\n        DF --&gt;|产出| IMG[镜像]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Dockerfile 最佳实践))&#10;    基础结构&#10;      FROM 基础镜像&#10;      WORKDIR 工作目录&#10;      COPY 复制文件&#10;      RUN 执行命令&#10;    多阶段构建&#10;      构建与运行分离&#10;      distroless 镜像&#10;      scratch 极致精简&#10;    层缓存优化&#10;      依赖先于代码复制&#10;      合并 RUN 指令&#10;      .dockerignore 过滤&#10;    安全加固&#10;      非 root 用户&#10;      不硬编码密钥&#10;      镜像漏洞扫描&#10;      HEALTHCHECK\">mindmap\n  root((Dockerfile 最佳实践))\n    基础结构\n      FROM 基础镜像\n      WORKDIR 工作目录\n      COPY 复制文件\n      RUN 执行命令\n    多阶段构建\n      构建与运行分离\n      distroless 镜像\n      scratch 极致精简\n    层缓存优化\n      依赖先于代码复制\n      合并 RUN 指令\n      .dockerignore 过滤\n    安全加固\n      非 root 用户\n      不硬编码密钥\n      镜像漏洞扫描\n      HEALTHCHECK</pre><ul>\n<li>Dockerfile 每条 <code>RUN</code>、<code>COPY</code>、<code>ADD</code> 指令创建一个新的镜像层，合理组织指令顺序可显著提升构建速度。</li>\n<li><strong>多阶段构建</strong>将编译环境与运行时环境分离，可将镜像大小从 GB 级缩小到 MB 级。</li>\n<li>层缓存的关键策略：先复制依赖清单文件并安装依赖，再复制源代码。</li>\n<li>安全加固三要素：非 root 用户运行、不在镜像中存储敏感信息、定期扫描镜像漏洞。</li>\n<li><code>.dockerignore</code> 文件应排除 <code>.git</code>、<code>node_modules</code>、<code>.env</code> 等敏感或无用文件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Dockerfile 最佳实践","id":"dockerfile-最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Dockerfile 基础结构","id":"dockerfile-基础结构"},{"level":2,"text":"多阶段构建","id":"多阶段构建"},{"level":2,"text":"层缓存优化","id":"层缓存优化"},{"level":2,"text":"安全加固","id":"安全加固"},{"level":2,"text":".dockerignore 与构建上下文","id":"dockerignore-与构建上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"容器与虚拟机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/container-vs-vm"},"next":{"title":"镜像管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/image-management"}}